URL:https://antir.org/events/athenaeum-7/
SUMMARY:Athenaeum
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, Their Excellencies of Madrone\, in partnership with
  the Laurels of An Tir\, invite artisans of all skill levels to journey to
  Athenaeum\, sponsored by the Barony of Madrone\, to showcase their artist
 ic skills to all the Realm. The populace is welcomed to be inspired and aw
 ed by the largest collection of artisans in An Tir\, in a non-competitive 
 Body of Work event.\n\nAthenaeum is an Art and Sciences event where regist
 ered Artisans and Scientists display their work to Laurels and to members 
 of the populace. This is not judged\, but an opportunity for an exchange o
 f ideas and appreciation of the work done behind the scenes.\n\nThe schedu
 le includes a day of viewing the displays of the artists\, talking to exhi
 bitors\, socializing with attendees\, and both Royal and Baronial Court. W
 e encourage you to attend and see all of the wonderful projects and engage
  with the artists.\n\nAthenaeum is designed to be a place for artisans to 
 display the breadth of their artistic abilities and receive valuable feedb
 ack and commentary from the Laurels of An Tir\, and artisans\, and attende
 es at the event in a relaxed\, collaborative\, and engaging environment.\n
 \nThe event is being held ot Renton Technical College\, 3000 NE 4th St\, R
 enton\, WA 98056. We are in Building I. Please use entrance 3 and follow t
 he SCA signs.
CATEGORIES:Madrone
LOCATION:Renton Technical College\, 3000 NE 4th Street\, Renton\, WA\, 9805
 6\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=3000 NE 4th Street\, Renton
 \, WA\, 98056\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Renton Technical 
 College:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
