DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260705T150000
DTSTAMP:20260616T174355Z
URL:https://antir.org/events/an-tir-west-war-16/
SUMMARY:An Tir West War
DESCRIPTION:Co-event Stewards SCA Names:  Viscountess Cempestrae i Holtasj
 on\, Kennara\, and Countess Astrid of the Fjordlands\nEvent Steward contac
 t:  eventstewards@antirwestwar.org\nEvent Name:   An Tir West War\nEv
 ent Site Open:   June 30\, 2026\, 12pm\nEvent Site Close:    July 5\, 
 2026\, 3pm\n&nbsp\;\nFurther Event Information:\nCome to the beautiful\, t
 emperate coastlands of Oregon for an epic war between the mighty SCA Kingd
 oms of the West and An Tir. Updates will be posted to https://antirwestwa
 r.org/\nExperience legendary armored combat and rapier war scenarios– so
 me with siege weapons\, combat archers\, and thrown weapons on the field o
 f battle! Participate in target archery and thrown weapons. Marvel at SCA 
 Equestrian activities. For non-combatants\, dive into Arts &amp\; Sciences
  classes\, cooking\, community and demos! Youth activities will run for th
 e entire war. Peruse our many fine merchants! Delicious food stalls are pa
 ramount to any war. Both Kingdoms will host Royal Court and Grand Court. R
 easonable ADA accommodations will be made for those who need them.\nThe AT
 WW Event Stewards\, Countess Astrid of the Fjordlands and Viscountess Cemp
 estrae i Holtasjon\, Kennara\, look forward to meeting you at the event!\n
 Volunteers are the backbone of a war\; please see the event website for in
 fo on how to sign up. There is almost no cell phone service on site.\nSite
  Name:   Lazy J Moore Ranch\nSite Address:   96029 Euchre Creek Rd. Go
 ld Beach\, OR 97444\nWritten Directions to Site:\nFrom the south: Make you
 r best way to Gold Beach\, Oregon. Head north on Hwy 101 about 13 miles. T
 urn right towards Coy Creek Rd. Turn right onto Coy Creek Rd. Turn left on
 to Euchre Creek Rd. This road has quite a few curves. NOTE: Be careful of 
 possible congestion at the Coy Creek Rd turnoff. From the north: Make your
  best way to Port Orford\, Oregon. Head south on Hwy 101 about 17 miles. T
 urn left towards Coy Creek Rd. Turn right onto Coy Creek Rd. Turn left ont
 o Euchre Creek Rd. NOTE: Be careful of possible congestion at the Coy Cree
 k Rd. turnoff.\nSite Accessibility:  Close / Handicap Parking\, Voice of
  the Populace (Silent Heralds) in Court\, Accessible privies\, DEIB event 
 staff\nTerrain Description:   Uneven ground\, hills\, valleys\, bridges
 \, can be swampy. Extremely variable dependent on rain patterns. Long gras
 s is mown shortly before the event\, so bring a rake (and maybe allergy me
 dication). Tends to be warm during the day and chilly at night. Often wind
 y during the day. This is a working farm and animals may be nearby. Please
  respect any signage!\nBodies of Water on/near Site:   Site has a river
  and creek\, and is a couple miles from the Pacific Ocean\nInsects or wild
  animals to be aware of on/ near site:   Domesticated farm animals. Wel
 l-behaved dogs are welcome. All dogs and adventure cats must be leashed at
  all times! Bring proof of current rabies vaccination with your pet. Clean
  up after your pets.\nAmenities on Site:  Portable privies\, ADA privies\
 , Hand-washing stations\, Showers\, RV parking (no hookups)\, Livestock st
 alls/housing. Cell service is almost completely unavailable.\nAdditional C
 omments: Cell service is almost completely unavailable.\nWeb Link: antir
 westwar.org\nFacebook link: https://www.facebook.com/ATWWar\n\nInstagram 
 link: https://www.instagram.com/antirwestwar
CATEGORIES:Kingdom of An Tir,Kingdom of the West
LOCATION:Lazy J Moore Ranch\, 96029 Euchre Creek Rd.\, Gold Beach\, OR\, 97
 444\, United States
GEO:42.5638902;-124.3635571
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=96029 Euchre Creek Rd.\, Go
 ld Beach\, OR\, 97444\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Lazy J Mo
 ore Ranch:geo:42.5638902,-124.3635571
END:VEVENT
