URL:https://antir.org/events/peasants-revel-23/
SUMMARY:Peasant's Revel
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 2: Branch Event where no Kingdom or Principalit
 y business is expected to be conducted event.\n\n12:00 PM7:00 PM\n\nPeasan
 t’s Revel is one of the Barony of Madrone’s most beloved events. The P
 easant’s Revel has been held every year since 1979\, although the event 
 was on hiatus from 2020 to 2022 and returned in 2023. The event is hosted 
 by the Barony of Madrone and the Madrone Culinary Guild.\n\nDress like a p
 easant. (Nobles\, you may want to send your illegitimate second cousin twi
 ce removed who looks remarkably like you.)\n\nRemember to bring a bowl\, a
  spoon\, a plate\, and your cup and napkin. The Madrone Culinary Guild wil
 l provide food and beverages.\n\nThere is no court and no meetings. This i
 s a great event for newcomers. Bring your children. Play and watch silly g
 ames.\n\nBring chairs or a picnic blanket\, your lunch and the beverages y
 ou prefer. This is a Bellevue city park. Wear comfortable peasant garb or 
 OK-to-get-grass-stains garb. There is shade available under the trees\, or
  you can bring a pop-up sunshade. You cannot drive stakes in the lawn.\n\n
 Event activities are primarily on grass in a mostly flat space.\n\nAmple p
 arking is available in an adjacent parking lot. Parking spaces within the 
 park can be for people with mobility challenges who need close parking. If
  you need close parking\, please contact the Event Steward in advance\, an
 d we will make every effort to save a close parking space.
CATEGORIES:Madrone
LOCATION:Spiritridge Park\, 16100 SE 33rd Pl\, Bellevue\, WA\, 98008\, Unit
 ed States
GEO:47.5804811;-122.1264778
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=16100 SE 33rd Pl\, Bellevue
 \, WA\, 98008\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Spiritridge Park:
 geo:47.5804811,-122.1264778
END:VEVENT
