URL:https://antir.org/events/corvid-crafting-convocation/
SUMMARY:Corvid Crafting Convocation
DESCRIPTION:This is a Level 2: Branch Event where no Kingdom or Principalit
 y business is expected to be conducted event.\n\n12:00 PM12:00 PM\n\nCome 
 join us for a weekend of creativity\, camaraderie\, and corvid cleverness!
  The Corvid Crafting Convocation is a limited-attendance\, pre-registratio
 n only arts and sciences retreat for artisans and makers of all kinds.\n\n
 Our gathering will take place in a beautiful park setting featuring:\n• 
 A white-sand pocket beach\, perfect for wading\, relaxing\, or kite flying
 \n• A spacious lodge with plenty of tables for classes and projects\n•
  A large outdoor fire pit\, ideal for cooking classes and demonstrations\n
 • Wide lawns for tents\, plus a limited number of cabin bunks (BYO beddi
 ng)\n• On-site bathrooms and showers for your comfort\n\nThe weekend wil
 l be full of opportunities to learn\, share\, and create:\n• Classes\, w
 orkshops\, and demos on diverse arts and sciences\n• A “show &amp\; te
 ll” for your latest projects\n• A supply swap table to exchange treasu
 res and materials\n• Unstructured “free play” crafting time\n• Sat
 urday evening bardic circle by the campfire\n\nFeast &amp\; Meals\nYour si
 te fee includes breakfast on Saturday and Sunday mornings\, as well as a s
 pecial Mesopotamian Bronze Age Feast on Saturday evening.\n\nSchedule\n•
  Event opens: Friday\, noon\n• Event closes: Sunday\, noon\n\nRegistrati
 on (Pre-registration only\, limited spaces—don’t delay!)\n• Full wee
 kend: $35 for members\, $45 for non-members\n• Day trip (includes meals 
 as applicable): $15 for members\, $25 for non-members\n\nWe anticipate thi
 s event will sell out quickly\, so register early to ensure your place at 
 the table.\n\nCome craft\, learn\, and share in good company—whether you
 r passion is fiber\, metal\, wood\, paint\, ink\, or something entirely un
 expected\, the Corvid Crafting Convocation welcomes you.
CATEGORIES:Crows Gate
LOCATION:Morehead Park\,  27600 Sandridge Rd\, Ocean Park\, WA\, 98640\, Ri
 vers\, United States
