DESCRIPTION:Preregistration and other event form links will be available at
  https://linktr.ee/AQBannerWar\n\nThe Barony of Aquaterra calls all houses
  of An Tir to raise their banners and declare to compete for the mighty wa
 r chest! Not with sword alone\, but with spicy skill and saucy swagger!\n\
 nIn the spirit of medieval feasting culture\, this year's Banner War cente
 rs on the bounty of the table\, the rivalry of the kitchen\, and the glory
  of those who can feed a crowd. Factions will compete not only in martial 
 prowess\, but in culinary artistry as they answer the age-old question: wh
 ich camp smells the best? It doesn’t matter if you're a seasoned fighter
  or someone who just showed up because their friend mentioned there would 
 be soup\, we have something for you.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThis is a Level 2: Bran
 ch Event where no Kingdom or Principality business is expected to be condu
 cted event.
